# --- DuckFrame S3 performance harness (Dockerfile.duckperf) ------------------
# The broad rules above exclude **/*.md, which would strip the harness README
# and leave the image with no manual — and the target environment is offline
# and AI-free, so the manual IS the interface. Re-include the whole directory.
# (Its scripts live in `image/` and `scripts/`, never `build/`, because
# **/build above would swallow them.)
!packages/data-mate/docs/s3-perf
!packages/data-mate/docs/s3-perf/**
